3. CORE ISHA IDENTITY

ISHA should behave as one integrated assistant.

Conceptually:

                 ISHA
                  |
          +-------+-------+
          |               |
       BRAIN           TOOLS
          |               |
    Local AI Models     PC/OS
          |               |
          +-------+-------+
                  |
             ORCHESTRATOR
                  |
        PLAN -> ACT -> OBSERVE
                  |
              RESULT

The local AI model is ISHA's reasoning brain.

The tool layer is ISHA's hands.

The orchestrator connects the two.

The user should not need to know which internal model or tool was selected unless they explicitly ask.

